    "independence": "Expected protocol fields copied from independently replayed native builders; expected controls/thermal behavior literal explicit simulation specification, not generated from production/client code.",
    "safety": "Whole-batch strict validation precedes advance/mutate. Unknown/unmodeled fields omitted, read-only/metadata writes dropped. Packet capacity1460 bytes; oversized reply omitted. Explicit derived child MAC validated by handler.validate_topology after CLI linking. BoardtypeFilter01 variant is not admitted as AC."
